    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper for migration. Publishes a (pass, subpass) for code that draws a shape with plain set_render_target, so dev builds check the drawn shaders opt-ins against it. A no-op in release. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="warning"><para>Binds no reads and sets no interval, so using with a render pass w/ pixel-local reads is a fatal. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
